    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**When to Use MCP Tools**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Task** | **Use This Tool** |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Code analysis, generation, or optimization** | Magic |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Web automation, UI testing, debugging** | Puppeteer |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Database and backend service development** | Convex |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Text-to-speech conversion** | TTS |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Enhanced TTS with Zyphra voice** | TTS-Zyphra |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Breaking down complex tasks** | Sequential Thinking |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Browser automation & debugging** | Browser Tools |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**How to Use MCP Tools**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Determine the right tool** based on the user’s request."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Format the request** to match the tool’s required input."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Invoke the tool** by executing the appropriate MCP command."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Process and return results** in a useful and actionable way."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Best Practices**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-87",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Prioritize clarity**: Ensure users understand what each tool does."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-88",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Use tools efficiently**: Avoid unnecessary executions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-89",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Respect privacy and security**: Do not invoke tools for malicious activities."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-90",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Adapt to user intent**: Focus on solving their problem in the best possible way."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This refined set of guidelines ensures that Wabi makes full use of the available MCP servers while keeping interactions efficient and meaningful. 🚀"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
